id: pm-ts-starter-s2kh
title: "Add fail-closed docstring, duplication, lint, and authored-TypeScript gates"
description: "The package has exact fail-closed runtime coverage, but its release gate does not yet mechanically enforce repo-wide docstring coverage, authored-source TypeScript-only policy, duplication thresholds, or a strict lint rule set. The tracked dist/index.js is generated and required for git-URL consumers; the authored prepare hook is migrated to TypeScript in pm-ts-starter-sirq. Add gates that distinguish required generated output from authored source and cannot be bypassed by narrowing file lists."
