expected_result: Mandatory source-quality policies fail closed in local and CI release gates.
actual_result: "docstring-gate EXIT=0 (9 files, 20 declarations), lint EXIT=0 (0 findings), duplication EXIT=0 (0 clone pairs), coverage 100/100/100, release:check green."
