close_reason: "Delivered across two passes. Docstring half: scripts/docstring-gate.ts is the thin pm-ops/docstrings launcher, wired into release:check and CI (docstring-gate: 9 file(s), 20 declaration(s) documented, EXIT=0), and CI runs the Node 22/26 matrix the issue asked for. Lint and duplication halves: delivered by pm-ts-starter-jwgz as thin pm-ops/eslint and pm-ops/duplication launchers (scripts/lint.ts, scripts/duplication-gate.ts) wired into release:check and CI, with the one pre-existing lint error and all 23 jscpd clone pairs fixed in code rather than suppressed (npm run lint EXIT=0; npm run duplication 0.00%, 0 clone pairs, EXIT=0). The generated-dist build verification the issue also names is CI's 'Build and verify committed output is current' step."
